{"id":"vod_bf_26670","vodId":"26670","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"漆黑的子弹","name_cn":"漆黑的子弹","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-27/692b46a3f70db4a7227ebbdb941948ee.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的二零二零年，在同神秘生物“原肠动物”的战争中，人类首次尝到了彻底失败的滋味，土地被剥夺，权利被压榨，在冷酷的独裁统治之下，人类被迫过起了苟且偷生的压抑生活。然而，即便如此，坚强的人们仍然没有放弃反抗的机会，为了对抗强大的敌人，“天童民间警备公司”成立了。　　表面看来，里见莲太郎（梶裕贵 配音）只是一介平凡的十六岁告众人，可实际上，他年纪轻轻就已经成为了“民警”中的一员，在搭档蓝原延珠（日高里菜 配音）的帮助下，莲太郎决定要找到莫名死亡的父母的真正死因。一个绝密任务的出现将莲太郎带往了巨大谜团的中心，在危险和杀戮之中，他最终会得到怎样的真相？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qiheidezidan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241021hyAKFnAKindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qiheidezidan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qiheidezidan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qiheidezidan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qiheidezidan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qiheidezidan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qiheidezidan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410215boz9WxKindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241021hfhEfsIcindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241021mpEHNUMZindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241021m6QThpf9index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/re